---

Leyline magic is movement and bad timing. You are not throwing fireballs. You are stepping through a crack and leaving someone frozen in last second.

A few you will actually keep on the bar:

- **Blink Step** — gone, then back, with a burst of haste. Panic button.
- **Rift Gate** — two linked portals. Drop one at camp, one in the hole you are exploring.
- **Chrono Tether** — everything in front of you slows down. You do not.
- **Temporal Stutter** — one target stuck mid-swing.
- **Fissure** — ground splits, things go flying.
- **Anchor Recall** — leave a pin, yank yourself back when the fight goes wrong.

There are more: Beam, Ley Blast, Eclipse, charge-and-spend tools. Treat the list like Iron’s other schools. Unlock what you use. Leave the rest until a rift drops the scroll.

If Codex is in the pack, Leyline is just another tab. A blacklist in Codex can hide the whole school if a pack author does not want portals in the overworld.
